# Credentials. These are here rather than in any one repo's .gitignore because
# the failure they prevent -- committing a key to a public repo -- is not one
# you get to notice per project, and this checkout's own repo is public. A
# pattern here costs nothing; the .local suffix is the convention the dotfiles
# already use for machine-specific files (.gitconfig.local, .zshrc.local) that
# are meant to stay on the machine.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
id_ecdsa*
*.local
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.netrc
credentials.json
service-account*.json
